instructions:
In package.json, at the text `"scripts": {
    "test": "node --test"
  }`: Replace with:
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test",
    "todo": "node src/todo-cli.js"
  }
so the tool is invoked as `npm run todo -- add buy milk`.
